# nLucky — Telegram Casino Bot

Premium mini-casino for Telegram on **aiogram 3.x**. Virtual currency only.

## Features

- 🟣 Inline-first UX (one edited message, dark-purple theme)
- 💰 Shared economy: balance, bank, transactions, XP/levels
- 🎮 Games: Dice, Slots, Coin Flip, Mines, Crash, Wheel, HiLo
- ⚔️ PvP Duel
- 📅 Daily & Weekly rewards
- 🎁 Missions (subscribe to channel)
- 🏆 Leaderboards
- 🛒 Shop & inventory
- 💼 Work / Crime / Beg
- 🛠 Admin panel (ban, promo, tasks, config reload)

## Requirements

- Python 3.11+
- PostgreSQL (prod) or SQLite (dev)
- Redis (optional — FSM + cooldowns; falls back to memory)

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate   # Windows
pip install -U pip
pip install .

copy .env.example .env
# fill BOT_TOKEN, set OWNER_TG_ID to your Telegram id
```

## Config

All game/economy values live in `config/economy.toml` — no hardcoding.

Reload without restart: `/admin_reload_config`

## Run

```bash
python -m nbet.bot
```

## Commands

| User | Admin |
|------|-------|
| `/start` | `/admin` |
| `/games` `/profile` | `/admin_stats` |
| `/daily` `/weekly` | `/admin_coins` |
| `/bank` `/shop` | `/admin_ban` `/admin_unban` |
| `/tasks` `/leaderboard` | `/admin_promo` |
| `/work` `/crime` `/beg` | `/admin_task_subscribe` |
| `/duel @user bet` | `/admin_setrole` |
| `/promo CODE` | `/admin_maintenance` |

## Architecture

```
nbet/
  bot.py              # entry + middleware
  settings.py         # env + TOML config
  config/economy.toml # all tunables
  db/                 # SQLAlchemy models
  services/           # economy, cooldown
  handlers/           # routers
  games/engine.py     # pure RNG logic
  ui/                 # theme + keyboards
```

## Lint

```bash
pip install ruff black
ruff check .
black .
```
